    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "1. The petitioner has filed the instant (second) petition under Section 482 of Bharatiya Nagarik\nSuraksha Sanhita, 2023 for grant of anticipatory bail in Fir No.034 dated 16.02.2024 registered\nunder Sections 420 and 120-B of IPC/Sections 318 and 61 of Bns, 2023, at Police Station Jhunir,\nDistrict Mansa.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 439,
      "end": 743,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "2. After arguing the case for some time and realising that this Court is not inclined to grant any relief\nto the petitioner in view of the fact that the petitioner was declared a proclaimed offender, vide\norder dated 19.12.2025 and the said order was challenged by him by filing Crm-M-9456-2026,\nwhich was disposed of by a Coordinate Bench of this Court, vide order dated 19.02.2026 and the\norder dated 19.12.2025, declaring the petitioner as proclaimed offender, was set aside and he was\ndirected to surrender before the learned Trial Court on or before 06.03.2026 subject to deposit of\nRs.10,000/- and with liberty to the 1 of 2 petitioner to apply for regular bail in the main case before\nthe learned Trial Court, which shall be decided on the same day, in accordance with law, instead of\nsurrendering before the learned Trial Court, the petitioner has filed the instant petition, faced with\nthis situation, learned counsel for the petitioner wishes to withdraw the present petition.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 745,
      "end": 1731,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Crm-M-9456-2026",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1024,
          "end": 1039
        },
        {
          "text": "19.02.2026",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1117,
          "end": 1127
        },
        {
          "text": "19.12.2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1148,
          "end": 1158
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "3. Dismissed as withdrawn.",
